WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.200
-Welcome back to
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.467
I'm Steve Higgins,

00:00:03.467 --> 00:00:06.033
and we're about to play a game
called "Pop Quiz."

00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:08.901
-♪ Pop quiz,
pop, pop quiz ♪

00:00:08.901 --> 00:00:10.801
♪ Pop quiz ♪

00:00:10.801 --> 00:00:14.334
-Wow. Our first contestant is
the host of "The Tonight Show."

00:00:14.334 --> 00:00:16.467
It's Jimmy Fallon.
-Hey, everybody!

00:00:16.467 --> 00:00:18.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:18.968 --> 00:00:20.834
And his opponent voices
Mario

00:00:20.834 --> 00:00:22.601
in "The Super Mario Bros.
Movie."

00:00:22.601 --> 00:00:24.267
Say hello to Mr. Chris Pratt.

00:00:24.267 --> 00:00:27.334
-Whoo-hoo!
It's a-me.

00:00:27.334 --> 00:00:29.501
-All right, gentlemen,
the rules are simple.

00:00:29.501 --> 00:00:31.667
Above you are two warp pipes,

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:34.267
both of which are clogged
with a mystery substance.

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:35.601
[ Audience laughs, murmurs ]

00:00:35.601 --> 00:00:36.634
Ooh.

00:00:36.634 --> 00:00:38.067
And because Mario
is a plumber,

00:00:38.067 --> 00:00:41.534
each of you have been fitted
with custom-made plunger hats.

00:00:41.534 --> 00:00:43.367
Now, I will ask you
a series of questions

00:00:43.367 --> 00:00:44.634
related to video games.

00:00:44.634 --> 00:00:46.200
And if you get an answer wrong

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:48.801
or if your opponent
gets an answer right,

00:00:48.801 --> 00:00:53.267
your chair will be risen closer
and closer to the pipe.

00:00:53.267 --> 00:00:56.234
And the first person
to reach the top of the pipe

00:00:56.234 --> 00:00:58.267
and plunges their pipe loses,

00:00:58.267 --> 00:01:01.868
and whatever's clogging the pipe
will be dumped upon you.

00:01:01.868 --> 00:01:03.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:05.567 --> 00:01:07.968
All right. Any questions?

00:01:07.968 --> 00:01:09.300
-Well, I was --
-Okay, great.

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:11.801
Chris, you'll be first.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.000
-Good luck.

00:01:21.567 --> 00:01:22.834
-Super Mario Bros.

00:01:22.834 --> 00:01:25.133
-Boom!
Let's see the answer!

00:01:25.133 --> 00:01:26.033
[ Ding! ]

00:01:26.033 --> 00:01:28.667
Yes! Super Mario Bros.!

00:01:28.667 --> 00:01:30.501
-Wow.
-Wow.

00:01:30.501 --> 00:01:33.133
That was a hard question.
I mean, James.

00:01:33.133 --> 00:01:35.200
Oh, yo!
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:36.400
-How was that a hard question?

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:37.968
It's basically every video game
right there.

00:01:37.968 --> 00:01:39.767
-Right. It was hard.
That was a difficult question.

00:01:39.767 --> 00:01:41.400
-Alright.
-Now, here's your question.

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:43.300
-Yeah.
Oh, good luck.

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:44.901
-Good luck, James.
-Yeah.

00:01:47.868 --> 00:01:50.100
[ Tense music plays ]

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:52.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.067 --> 00:01:53.567
Who's the creator?

00:01:53.567 --> 00:01:57.067
-I mean, I'm a Nintendo nerd.
I'm going to say Miyamoto?

00:01:57.067 --> 00:01:59.167
-Judges?

00:01:59.167 --> 00:02:01.167
[ Ding! ]
Yes!

00:02:01.167 --> 00:02:04.767
Shigeru Miyamoto.
Chris.

00:02:04.767 --> 00:02:06.133
Ready?

00:02:06.133 --> 00:02:08.133
-[ Grunts ]
[ Video game sounds play ]

00:02:08.133 --> 00:02:10.701
Yeah. Ohh!

00:02:10.701 --> 00:02:12.334
He's more man than you. Okay.

00:02:12.334 --> 00:02:14.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:16.467
-What?
-Wow.

00:02:16.467 --> 00:02:18.367
-Hurt my leg.
-My God.

00:02:18.367 --> 00:02:20.501
-Oy!
-God.

00:02:20.501 --> 00:02:22.067
-[ Laughing ] What's the name --

00:02:22.067 --> 00:02:23.968
Chris?
-Yes.

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:30.400
This is a hard one.
-Pfft!

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:32.434
-Travel across 1800s America?
-Yeah.

00:02:32.434 --> 00:02:36.434
-Okay, Now I'm going to phone
a friend on this -- uh, myself.

00:02:36.434 --> 00:02:38.033
-Oh.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.033 --> 00:02:40.701
-Hello? Yeah, uh, is that --

00:02:40.701 --> 00:02:42.534
I think it's, uh, Oregon Trail?

00:02:42.534 --> 00:02:44.567
-Let's see.
Let's see the answer.

00:02:44.567 --> 00:02:46.734
Oregon Trail! Yes!
-Hey!

00:02:46.734 --> 00:02:48.400
I played that at school.
-Oh, my God.

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:50.367
-I played that in school.

00:02:50.367 --> 00:02:52.033
-You died of dysentery.
You got to say --

00:02:52.033 --> 00:02:54.167
-He died of a snake bite.
-Ready, Jimmy?

00:02:54.167 --> 00:02:55.701
-You're going up.

00:02:55.701 --> 00:02:58.167
Ohhhhh, my gosh!

00:02:58.167 --> 00:03:01.300
Okay, Jimmy,
next question is for you.

00:03:06.834 --> 00:03:08.567
You know this.

00:03:08.567 --> 00:03:10.901
-Well, first, I want to give
a shout-out to my...

00:03:10.901 --> 00:03:12.634
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:12.634 --> 00:03:14.734
-...my buddy Weasel
back at home in Boston.

00:03:14.734 --> 00:03:16.501
You know, I love you, Weaz.

00:03:16.501 --> 00:03:19.133
Uh, you're talking about
EA Sports. Come on.

00:03:19.133 --> 00:03:20.334
-All right,
let's see the answer.

00:03:20.334 --> 00:03:22.234
-Electronic Arts.
-Yeah!

00:03:22.234 --> 00:03:23.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:23.367 --> 00:03:25.000
Okay. Chris.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.501
Oh, my God. So close.
-Aaaah!

00:03:27.501 --> 00:03:29.634
♪ So close ♪

00:03:29.634 --> 00:03:31.467
-If it's in the game --
-Alright, Chris.

00:03:31.467 --> 00:03:33.267
Next question is to you.
-Okay.

00:03:40.801 --> 00:03:42.133
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:42.133 --> 00:03:44.000
-Not "what," like his name.
Like, what is his name?

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:45.701
Not what.
-Blinky.

00:03:45.701 --> 00:03:46.968
-Inky.
-Inky.

00:03:46.968 --> 00:03:49.067
-Pinky and...
-Pinky and...

00:03:49.067 --> 00:03:50.167
[ Drumroll ]

00:03:50.167 --> 00:03:51.567
It's kind of ra--
I don't know.

00:03:51.567 --> 00:03:53.367
I'm going to
have to take a guess.

00:03:53.367 --> 00:03:55.234
Uh, Juanita?

00:03:55.234 --> 00:03:57.067
-[ Laughs ]
-Juanita.

00:03:57.067 --> 00:03:58.133
-Jimmy, do you know
the answer?

00:03:58.133 --> 00:04:00.400
-I do, but it's not --
It doesn't rhyme.

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:02.968
It's like Gary or something.
Or Paul or something.

00:04:02.968 --> 00:04:04.467
-Let's see. Judges,
let's see the answer.

00:04:04.467 --> 00:04:06.901
-If it's Gary, I'm gonna be --
-It's Clyde!

00:04:06.901 --> 00:04:08.367
Oh, Chris. One more.

00:04:08.367 --> 00:04:10.601
Ohh, so close!

00:04:10.601 --> 00:04:12.968
-Oh, my God.
-Jimmy.

00:04:12.968 --> 00:04:15.300
-[ Laughs ]
-Next question is for you.

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:17.934
-Yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes!

00:04:17.934 --> 00:04:19.200
Clyde.

00:04:22.267 --> 00:04:23.367
Yes. Yes.

00:04:24.567 --> 00:04:25.601
-...not Trump...
-Q-Bert.

00:04:26.934 --> 00:04:28.601
You're just gonna jump
right on it? Q-Bert?

00:04:28.601 --> 00:04:30.667
Let's see the answer.

00:04:30.667 --> 00:04:32.334
[ Ding! ]
Yes!

00:04:32.334 --> 00:04:33.601
-Q-Bert.

00:04:33.601 --> 00:04:36.033
♪♪

00:04:36.033 --> 00:04:37.634
[ Laughing ] Oh!

00:04:37.634 --> 00:04:39.667
Oh, my gosh.
Chris.

00:04:39.667 --> 00:04:41.534
-Are you kidding me?
-Next question is for you.

00:04:41.534 --> 00:04:43.033
-What, does his head
gotta go in the pipe?!

00:04:43.033 --> 00:04:44.300
-Well, he's got to go
in the pipe.

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:45.567
And that's not -- Trust me.
-For heaven's sakes.

00:04:45.567 --> 00:04:47.367
-You don't want to get
that dumped on your head.

00:04:47.367 --> 00:04:48.801
[ Balloon pops ]
Oh!

00:04:48.801 --> 00:04:52.501
[ Laughter ]

00:04:52.501 --> 00:04:53.968
-Wow!

00:04:53.968 --> 00:04:56.667
Laughter! His laughter!

00:04:56.667 --> 00:04:58.601
His laughter,
that's what got him!

00:04:58.601 --> 00:05:00.100
He's a good sport.

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:01.667
-Let's see the slow-mo of that!

00:05:01.667 --> 00:05:02.968
[ Cheers and applause ]
Oh!

00:05:02.968 --> 00:05:04.901
-Chris Pratt, everybody.

00:05:04.901 --> 00:05:06.634
The champion!

00:05:06.634 --> 00:05:08.701
Go see "Super Mario Bros."

00:05:08.701 --> 00:05:10.934
in theaters this Wednesday
and IMAX.

00:05:10.934 --> 00:05:12.267
My thank-you to Chris Pratt.

00:05:12.267 --> 00:05:14.634
We'll be right back with
More "Tonight Show," everybody.

